<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Fe Pacific downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Fe Pacific downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>- EVEREN Securities Inc said Tuesday it downgraded Santa Fe Pacific Gold Corp to near-term market performer from near-term outperformer, because the stock price has nearly met EVEREN's intermediate-term price objective.</p>
<p>- The stock is up 60 percent from its initial recommendation, EVEREN said.</p>
<p>- Santa Fe closed off 1/8 at 17-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
